WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.100
Is this the real life?

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.060
Is this just fantasy?

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:11.400
Caught in a landslide, no escape from reality.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.020
Open your eyes.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.200
Look up to the skies, and see...

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.280
I'm just a poor boy, I need no sympathy.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.860
Because I'm easy come, easy go.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.320
little high...

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.060
little low.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.680
Anyway the wind blows.
It doesn't really matter to me.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.020
...to me...

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.860
Mama, I just killed a man.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:57.880
Put a gun against his head, pulled my trigger, now he's dead.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.880
Mama...

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.100
Life had just begun, now I've gone and thrown it all away.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:06.340
(mother cries)

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.880
I didn't mean to make you cry.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.520
If I'm not back again, this time tomorrow...

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.200
Carry on.
Carry on, as if...

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.120
...nothing really matters.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:27.280
It's too late.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.960
My time has come.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.620
Sends shivers down my spine...

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.660
Body's aching all the time.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.960
Goodbye everybody, I gotta go.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.700
Gotta leave you all behind.
Face the truth.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.480
Mama.
(mother cries)

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.080
I don't wanna die.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.820
I sometimes wish I'd never been born at all.

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:14.580
I see a little silhouetto of a man.
- Scaramouche, scaramouche.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.420
Will you do the fandango?

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:24.200
Thunderbolt...

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.540
...and lightning.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.920
Very very frightening.
Me.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.540
Galileo.
- Galileo!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.380
Galileo, figaro.
- Magnifico.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:42.360
I'm just a poor boy.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.920
Nobody loves me.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.180
He's just a poor boy, from a poor family!

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.620
Spare him his life from this monstrosity.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.980
Easy come, easy go.

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.080
Will you let me go?
- Bismillah!

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.100
No.
- We will not let you go.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.860
Let him go, bismillah.
- We will not let you go.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:03.060
Let him go, bismillah.
- We will not let you go!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.220
Let me go.
- Will not let you go.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.580
Let me go.
- Never.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.740
Never let you go.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:11.020
Let... me go.
- Never!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.620
Ah, let me go!
- Ooh...

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:16.720
No. No, no, no!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.920
No, no, no.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.100
Oh mama mia, mama mia!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:28.500
Mama mia, let me go.
- Beelzebub has a devil put aside for me.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.380
For me.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.220
For me.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.560
Anyway the wind blows.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.200
(Bloopers)

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.900
(Advertisement)

